			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1826709">
									

<p>Well thank you sir, it hadn't struck me what a severe punishment exile was. I was using my own frame of reference, but if that's enough to keep people in line, then I guess I don't need an elaborate system of checkery.</p>
